sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant CLI as odd/cli.py<br/>build_parser() + main() + _dispatch()
  participant Registry as odd/registry.py
  participant ExtReg as odd/extension_registry.py
  participant Schema as odd/schema_manifest.py
  participant FS as repo files

  User->>CLI: uv run odd validate
  CLI->>Registry: registry_validation.validate_registry(registry/sources.yml, schema/source.schema.json)
  Registry->>FS: read registry/sources.yml + schema/source.schema.json
  Registry-->>CLI: list[ValidationError]
  CLI-->>User: pass/fail text

  User->>CLI: uv run odd index/search/show/sql
  CLI->>Registry: registry_model.load/search/find + registry_renderers.render_*()
  Registry->>FS: read registry/sources.yml
  Registry-->>CLI: Source objects or rendered output
  CLI-->>User: text/json/SQL

  User->>CLI: uv run odd generate-index / generate-site
  CLI->>Registry: registry_renderers.write_index_artifacts() / write_site_index()
  Registry->>FS: read registry/sources.yml
  Registry->>FS: write docs/index.md or site/index.html
  Registry-->>CLI: written paths
  CLI-->>User: paths

  User->>CLI: uv run odd generate-extension-registry --check
  CLI->>ExtReg: check_extension_registry_header()
  ExtReg->>Registry: registry_model.load_sources()
  Registry->>FS: read registry/sources.yml
  ExtReg->>FS: compare src/include/open_data_duck_registry.generated.hpp
  ExtReg-->>CLI: drift problems or empty list
  CLI-->>User: current or drift report

  User->>CLI: uv run odd schema inspect/check/refresh
  CLI->>Schema: inspect_source_schema() / check_source_schema() / refresh_manifest_for_sources()
  Schema->>Registry: registry_model.find/load + registry_renderers.render_source_sql()
  Schema->>FS: read/write schema/source-manifest.json
  Schema-->>CLI: schema JSON or compatibility result
  CLI-->>User: schema output
